display_name = "Bars"
mimics = "Alprazolam (benzodiazepines)"
blurb = "A bar of soap from the laundromat. Nothing bothers you now. Nothing at all. What were you doing?"
codex_fact = "Benzodiazepines cause genuine anterograde amnesia — they do not just calm you, they interfere with forming new memories, which is why they are given before surgery so patients do not remember it. That is why this one deletes your score and your clock: the game is not hiding information from you, it is showing you what the drug does. They are also among the most dangerous drugs to stop abruptly, unlike almost everything else on this list."
